    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earth had no sun, but the gods had a plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sacrifices were held, and the sun was created. But it was still. Movement was needed. And Xolotl was the chosen one. His sacrifice would make the sun move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The problem was, Xolotl didn't want to die. So he escaped to the mortal world, losing his godly form and powers. Now he wants them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong><i>Travel the vast Aztec lands in the search of obtaining your godly powers, fight powerful gods and their henchmen, and befriend many animals!</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fantastic, dynamic movement, with tight controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modern Pixel-Art, with detailed backgrounds, colorful worlds, and modern lighting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with sneaky snakes, loud lizards, and funny frogs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter henchmen, godlings, and animals that want to kill you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel along a linear, yet open world. Everything is 'one big level', yet you'll always know where to go. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An amazing soundtrack worthy of an amazing world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earth had no sun, but the gods had a plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sacrifices were held, and the sun was created. But it was still. Movement was needed. And Xolotl was the chosen one. His sacrifice would make the sun move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The problem was, Xolotl didn't want to die. So he escaped to the mortal world, losing his godly form and powers. Now he wants them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong><i>Travel the vast Aztec lands in the search of obtaining your godly powers, fight powerful gods and their henchmen, and befriend many animals!</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fantastic, dynamic movement, with tight controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modern Pixel-Art, with detailed backgrounds, colorful worlds, and modern lighting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with sneaky snakes, loud lizards, and funny frogs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter henchmen, godlings, and animals that want to kill you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel along a linear, yet open world. Everything is 'one big level', yet you'll always know where to go. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An amazing soundtrack worthy of an amazing world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Jump, dash, and swim in this epic adventure! Explore the vast Aztec lands in an axolotl action-platformer! Xolotl is a cute, 2D action-platformer, in which your goal is to regain your godly form and powers.",
